      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_37",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Baldras",
            x: 23,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Harper",
            unit: "Harper",
            x: 21,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            role: "Advisor",
            unit: "",
            x: 25,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Baldras",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("Baldras! Ya made it! Lil Harper here told me all about what happened."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Aye, Relana. It were one o’ the Queen’s patrol, strange as it do sound. Turns out they was itchin’ to attack us soon as I wasn’t willing to leave with ‘em."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("But we fought those ugly scoundrels off!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("Queen’s patrol, ya say? They sent them a messenger our way a couple days ago, demanding our allegiance to some ‘Asheviere’. Weren’t that Garard’s young bride or something? Why’s she the one in charge now?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("I don’t know, but some of them riders escaped us. Bet they’ll report back to their local garrison, tell them we’re a bunch o’ traitors."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Advisor",
            text: _("Then they’ll be comin’ back in force."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("We needs more information. We should consult ourselves with Elensefar. Lord Maddock surely gots to know more than us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Elensefar? Why him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("Well all Annuvin be ruled by Elensefar, right? We don’t gots to heed anything Wesnoth says. Lord Maddock’s technically the one we answer to."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("It don’t matter. Weldyn be doing whatever it likes while Maddock says nothing. He knows, but he don’t care."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("But we still need that knowledge, Baldras. We can’t be coming up with any great plan without no information. We both knows that if Weldyn brings one o’ their armies here, there be no way we can fight them off."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Perhaps, but — hold there. Did ya hear that? Sounded like some wolf howl."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("Somethin’ smells like lizard too. We’re not alone here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Harper",
            text: _("Finally, some action!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "casualties_of_war.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Urk Delek",
            x: 32,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urk Delek",
            text: _("Blasted humans and blasted Fal Khag! Stupid goblin was only supposed to scout that puny village, not fight it by himself. Then those damned humans rejected our help and look where that got them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urk Delek",
            text: _("“Don’t know why the Queen hired some stinkin’ orcs, we don’t need you here.” Yeah, well now they’re dead like a bunch of beasts."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Thhsthss",
            x: 6,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thhsthss",
            text: _("Your ordersss mean nothing to usss, orc. You promissed uss gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Urk Delek",
            text: _("Shut your trap, lizard. You’ll get your gold as soon as my wolves get their meat."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_38",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("We gots to be headin’ for Elensefar soon before them Wesnothians come back."),
          },
        ],
      },
