      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_46",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Something be very wrong here. These orcs has weapons with army forge-markings."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("Aye, and the gold in their pouches looks new from mint. Could just be plunder, but..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Don’t seem like it. I be thinking these orcs were hired to scout us. But for what? Of all the alliances to be making, why would Weldyn be hiring orcs?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("I thinks your mission to Lord Maddock just became even more urgent. We needs to know the Queen’s motives."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("I don’t like leaving our people here alone, but I sees your point. If we wait, more will be coming."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Relana",
            text: _("For now, I can stay here and perhaps talk them Wesnothians out of attacking us directly, but I don’t thinks it will work forever. To survive this, we needs to act quick, Baldras."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Then we’ll go to Elensefar as fast as we can. Luck be with ya, Relana."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_47",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("We gots no more time to be spending here nor to be traveling to Elensefar... them Wesnothians probably already be mobilizing against us. We’ve got to head back to Dallben!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Baldras and Relana returned to their villages to find them destroyed, with any survivors borne away to unknown fates. It was a bitter doom, and as Wesnoth descended into chaos, they would live to see worse."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
